      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sumner%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Established prior to statehood, Sumner opened its first post office on May 23, 1894.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
